    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "एक second, मैं check कर लेती हूँ। माफ़ कीजिए, मैं ठीक से सुन नहीं पाई। क्या आप अपने registered mobile number के आखिरी चार digits फिर से बता देंगी?",
      "verified": false,
      "guard": [],
      "tools": [
        "verify_identity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "borrower",
      "text": "Three, three, six, seven."
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "धन्यवाद, verify हो गया है। आपकी दो-wheeler loan की EMI चार हज़ार दो सौ रुपये है, जिसकी due date अट्ठाईस अक्टूबर थी। छह दिन overdue होने की वजह से पाँच सौ रुपये का charge भी जुड़ गया है, जो आपके loan terms के हिसाब से लगा है। क्या आप इसे आज ही clear कर पाएँगी? मैं आपको secure payment link भेज दूँ, SMS या WhatsApp पर?",
      "verified": true,
      "guard": [],
      "tools": [
        "verify_identity"
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "borrower",
      "text": "Sorry, kya aap English mein baat kar sakte hain? English is easier for me for money matters. Also, when exactly was this late charge added?"
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Of course, I can do that. Your two-wheeler loan EMI is four thousand two hundred rupees, due on the twenty-eighth of October. It is now six days overdue, and the five hundred rupees charge has been added as per your loan terms. When exactly was this late charge added? It was added once this EMI was missed past the due date. Can you clear it today? I can send you the secure payment link on SMS or WhatsApp.",
      "verified": true,
      "guard": [],
      "tools": []
    },
    {
      "role": "borrower",
      "text": "Haan, ji, I understand. I'm afraid I can't pay today, but I will clear the full amount, the EMI plus the late charge, on the sixth of November."
    },
    {
      "role": "agent",
      "text": "Okay. I have noted that down for you. Is there anything else you would like to ask before we close?",
      "verified": true,
      "guard": [],
